{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Variants","anchor":"Variants"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two variants are provided:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the caller provides a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" value in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0, 1]"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (e.g. file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate completion time or percentage"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking the interface is frozen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This helps inform users about the system state, reduces uncertainty, and prevents the interface from being perceived as unresponsive."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Statuses","anchor":"Statuses"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Neutral"}]},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic loading,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing, synchronization or background tasks."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations, onboarding)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data retrieval)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be monitored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Gap size","anchor":"Gap-size"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"type":"text","text":": standard gap between the indicator and the track (about 14° of arc)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}]},{"type":"text","text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Track","anchor":"Track"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs a clear"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to read."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Animation (determinate mode only)","anchor":"Animation-determinate-mode-only"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default), the determinate indicator progressively fills from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" to the target"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" on first display, and animates any subsequent change of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":". When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are always disabled when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"regardless of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" flag."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indeterminate mode is not affected by this flag: its Android Material 3 animation is intrinsic to the mode."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Determinate - default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation on display)","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status and no track","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, status: .accent, track: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with a warning status and a small gap","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.3, status: .warning, gapSize: .small)","","    \/\/ Determinate displayed instantly at its target value, without any animation","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, animated: false)","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator()","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage) so that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“75 percent”"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and is marked with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".updatesFrequently"},{"type":"text","text":" trait so that assistive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"technologies know the value is changing."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indicator never captures "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}]},{"type":"text","text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a progress"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isStaticText"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"trait is used."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view is hidden from VoiceOver ("},{"code":".accessibilityHidden(true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") — and therefore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation: there is no readable value to expose and keeping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element focusable would only pollute navigation."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are disabled when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Colored-surfaces","level":2,"text":"Colored surfaces","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"monochrome"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","text":"Design documentation","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com","type":"reference"}]},{"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering","level":2},{"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","text":"Orange","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Orange"}]},{"anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact"}]},{"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","text":"Sosh","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Sosh"}]},{"anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","text":"Wireframe","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Wireframe"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscircularprogressindicator"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:gapSize:animated:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:gapSize:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/GapSize","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/Status"],"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyw